'''Globins''' chase after Isaac, similar to {{e|Gaper}}s but are much faster. Instead of dying, they will collapse into goo and then regenerate after a few moments unless destroyed in their goo form. Each time a Globin is turned into goo form, it will have its total health decreased. Globins will do 1 full heart of damage on contact.
{{clear}}

