=== Cursed Globin ===
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = r
 | name        = Cursed Globin
 | variant     = 3
 | base hp     = 33
 | environment = {{floor|Mausoleum}}{{floor|Gehenna}}<br>{{room|challenge}}
