'''Black Globins''' walk towards Isaac, launching {{e|Spider}}s towards Isaac every time it takes damage. Upon death, they spawn another spider and split into a {{e|Black Globin's Head}} and a {{e|Black Globin's Body}}. This makes them the only Globin variant that doesn't have a goo form.

