== Trivia ==
* {{E|Sloth}} is a recolored Globin.
* {{E|Super Sloth}} is a recolored Gazing Globin with a large head.
* The name of the monster is a [[wikipedia:globin|type of protein]] and is also similar to a [[wikipedia:Goblin|goblin]].
* Globins appear to be based on the [[castlevania:Red Skeleton|Red Skeletons]] from the ''Castlevania'' series since they reform from their pile of bones after being killed. They can only be killed using a special weapon or spell.
* {{dlc|r}}Clickety Clacks seem to be based on Dry Bones, a ''Mario'' enemy that has a similar mechanic.
* {{dlc|r}}The [[anti:Cursed Globins|Cursed Globins]] first appeared in the ''Antibirth'' mod where they regenerated at a slower rate.
* {{dlc|r}}Cursed Globins act similarly to [[nuclearthrone:Cursed Crystal Spider|Cursed Crystal Spiders]] from ''Nuclear Throne''.

